mVolt+ (by b00nz) is kept in a mVolt+ folder next to ClevoTune and updated automatically from its GitHub releases (checked at most every 12 hours). ClevoTune runs it through its command line for the power limit when the NVIDIA driver blocks it, and for the core voltage offset.=mVolt+ (by b00nz) is kept in a mVolt+ folder next to ClevoTune and updated automatically from its GitHub releases (checked at most every 12 hours). ClevoTune runs it through its command line for the power limit when the NVIDIA driver blocks it, and for the core voltage offset.
The power limit is locked on this GPU: NVML, NVAPI and mVolt+ all refused it, so the slider was disabled.=The power limit is locked on this GPU: NVML, NVAPI and mVolt+ all refused it, so the slider was disabled.
