ClevoTune runs mVolt+ (by b00nz) through its command line for the power limit when the NVIDIA driver blocks it, and for the core voltage offset. mVolt+ is searched next to ClevoTune, in a mVolt+ subfolder, Downloads, Desktop and its own install folder.=ClevoTune runs mVolt+ (by b00nz) through its command line for the power limit when the NVIDIA driver blocks it, and for the core voltage offset. mVolt+ is searched next to ClevoTune, in a mVolt+ subfolder, Downloads, Desktop and its own install folder.
